    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognitive Level <Assistant_Red>37</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Family</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250091}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the name of the family, with oaths as locks, be each other's anchors on the edge of the abyss of fate. Find friends with common goals to establish a family contract, complete family quests to increase family level, and obtain <Assistant_Property1>Companion Emblems</> to exchange for <Assistant_Property1>precious rewards</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Detailed Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[家族-契约方式]|666}, {SendAnswer:[家族-奖励说明]|667}, {SendAnswer:[家族-等级规则]|668}, {SendAnswer:[家族-展台规则]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognitive Level <Assistant_Red>37</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Family</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250091}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the name of the family, with oaths as locks, be each other's anchors on the edge of the abyss of fate. Find friends with common goals to establish a family contract, complete family quests to increase family level, and obtain <Assistant_Property1>Companion Emblems</> to exchange for <Assistant_Property1>precious rewards</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Detailed Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Family - Contract Methods]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Explanation]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Level Rules]|668}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Showcase Rules]|669}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Seeds of Courage】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>By the cabin at Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Sequence 9, and go to {Location:[金秋湖(289,163)]|18588;6687;50;2;5200085;0}the location to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Seeds of Courage】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>By the cabin at Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Sequence 9, and go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(289,163)]|18588;6687;50;2;5200085;0}the location to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【人脉好感】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>各位非凡者可以通过消耗<Assistant_Red>【漫忆请柬】</>道具，邀请自己拥有的人脉完成漫步、邀约、共舞或者书信往来等4种互动并且获得对应人脉的好感度。每日首次与人脉互动不消耗邀请券（书信往来首次互动也需要消耗邀请券），所有人脉共享该免费次数。与同一人脉进行同一类型互动并邀请券后，当日内再次进行该类型互动将不再消耗邀请券，也不再获得好感度。\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>45级</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>查看方式：</>按F11进入人脉界面，选中对应人脉后，点击右上角提升好感即可进入人脉好感度界面。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励</>：记忆珍匣、发票收据、认知经验等"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Connection Favorability】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>Every Beyonder can consume <Assistant_Red>【Memory Invitation】</> items to invite their connections to complete 4 types of interactions: Strolling, Appointment, Dancing, or Correspondence, and gain corresponding favorability. The first interaction with a connection each day does not consume an invitation (Correspondence also requires an invitation for the first interaction); all connections share this free attempt. After interacting with the same connection in the same way and using an invitation, subsequent interactions of that type within the same day will not consume invitations nor grant favorability. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Method: </>Reach <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 45</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to View: </>Press F11 to enter the Connections interface, select the corresponding connection, and click \"Increase Favorability\" in the top right corner to enter the Connection Favorability interface. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rewards</>: Memory Box, Invoice Receipt, Cognition EXP, etc.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【排行榜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-排行</>即可查看排行榜，在本服内查看的排行榜，均为本服内的数据。\n<Assistant_Title2>刷新时间：</>除少数特殊情况外，排行榜<Assistant_Red>每1分钟</>刷新一次数据。\n<Assistant_Title2>清榜时间：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>世界Boss分数：</>每周一8：00清榜\n    <Assistant_Property1>铁路大亨赚取值：</>每周一8：01清榜\n<Assistant_Title2>使用指南：</>进入排行榜系统后，左侧列表可以切换<Assistant_Red>排行榜类型</>，点击切换后，可以在排行榜上方点击切换该类型下具体的排行榜。右侧展示对应玩家的模型、外观。\n<Assistant_Title2>排行筛选：</>在排行榜系统中，部分排行榜可以进行<Assistant_Red>筛选</>，如左下角的<Assistant_Red>全服/好友筛选</>、排行榜上方的<Assistant_Red>途径筛选</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>排行奖励：</>部分排行榜会定期<Assistant_Red>结算、发奖</>，可以点击页面右上角<Assistant_Red>奖励预览</>来查看对应<Assistant_Red>排名奖励</>，排行榜最下方有文字显示结算、发奖的时间。\n<Assistant_Title2>排行类型：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>个人：</>风尚度 等级 成就点 秩序世界\n    <Assistant_Property1>俱乐部：</>俱乐部等级 俱乐部评分 歌剧魅影 俱乐部联赛\n    <Assistant_Property1>竞技：</>主宰争锋 命运时刻 神座之争 终末猎杀\n    <Assistant_Property1>副本：</>安提哥努斯笔记 乌托邦剧院·噩梦 五月庄园·花园等\n    <Assistant_Property1>家族：</>家族非凡评分 家族风尚度\n    <Assistant_Property1>城堡：</>铁路大亨\n    <Assistant_Property1>躺赢：</>副本 同行 冒险 趣斗\n    <Assistant_Property1>教团：</>春夜舞会"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Leaderboard】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Description: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Ranking</> to view the leaderboard. The rankings viewed within the server are all data within the current server. \n<Assistant_Title2>Refresh Time: </>Except for a few special cases, the leaderboard <Assistant_Red>refreshes data every 1 minute</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Reset Time: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>World Boss Score: </>Reset every Monday at 8:00\n    <Assistant_Property1>Railway Tycoon Earnings: </>Reset every Monday at 8:01\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the leaderboard system, the list on the left can switch <Assistant_Red>Leaderboard Types</>. After switching, you can click above the leaderboard to switch to specific rankings under that type. The right side displays the corresponding player's model and appearance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Filter: </>In the leaderboard system, some rankings can be <Assistant_Red>filtered</>, such as the <Assistant_Red>Server-wide/Friends filter</> in the bottom left, and the <Assistant_Red>Pathway filter</> above the leaderboard. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Rewards: </>Some leaderboards will periodically <Assistant_Red>settle and distribute rewards</>. You can click <Assistant_Red>Reward Preview</> in the top right corner of the page to view the corresponding <Assistant_Red>ranking rewards</>. The bottom of the leaderboard displays the time for settlement and reward distribution. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Types: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Personal: </>Fashion Level, Level, Achievement Points, Orderly World\n    <Assistant_Property1>Club: </>Club Level, Club Rating, Phantom of the Opera, Club League\n    <Assistant_Property1>Competition: </>Dominator's Clash, Moment of Fate, Battle for the Throne of God, Final Hunt\n    <Assistant_Property1>Dungeon: </>Antigonus Notebook, Utopia Theater · Nightmare, May Manor · Garden, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Family: </>Family Extraordinary Rating, Family Fashion Level\n    <Assistant_Property1>Castle: </>Railway Tycoon\n    <Assistant_Property1>Easy Win: </>Dungeon, Ride Along, Adventure, Fun Fight\n    <Assistant_Property1>Cult: </>Spring Night Ball",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【飓风之斧】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，战斗中提升自身<Assistant_Red>移动速度</>与<Assistant_Red>普攻攻速</>，普攻命中时概率造成<Assistant_Red>滞涩</>并触发闪电伤害；对目标触发闪电时，有概率触发闪电击中自己。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>副本记忆的传承一获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Hurricane Axe] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Attack-type Sealed Artifact \n <Assistant_Title2> Details: </> Competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Increases your <Assistant_Red> Movement Speed </> and <Assistant_Red> Basic Attack Speed </> in combat. Basic attacks have a chance to cause <Assistant_Red> Stagnation </> and trigger lightning damage. When triggering lightning on a target, there is a chance to trigger lightning on yourself. \n <Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained from the Inheritance of Memory I dungeon.",
